From: Michal Novacek <mnovacek@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 15:03:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] fix(reports): use managed HtmlPanel renderer on Linux
X-Organization: Red Hat, Inc.
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: multipart/mixed; boundary="------------2.52.0"

This is a multi-part message in MIME format.
--------------2.52.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8; format=fixed
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit


NativeWebView (WebKitGTK) fails to composite inside the Avalonia window
on Linux, leaving report dialogs blank. Use HtmlPanel from
Avalonia.HtmlRenderer as a managed fallback on non-Windows platforms.
Windows behavior is unchanged (still uses WebView2).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Michal Novacek <mnovacek@redhat.com>
